{"info":{"author":null,"author_email":"Guillaume Ayoub <guillaume.ayoub@kozea.fr>, Unrud <unrud@outlook.com>, Peter Bieringer <pb@bieringer.de>","bugtrack_url":null,"classifiers":["Development Status :: 5 - Production/Stable","Environment :: Console","Environment :: Web Environment","Intended Audience :: End Users/Desktop","Intended Audience :: Information Technology","License :: OSI Approved :: GNU General Public License (GPL)","Operating System :: OS Independent","Programming Language :: Python :: 3","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.10","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.13","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.9","Programming Language :: Python :: Implementation :: CPython","Programming Language :: Python :: Implementation :: PyPy","Topic :: Office/Business :: Groupware"],"description":"# Radicale\n\n[![Test](https://github.com/Kozea/Radicale/actions/workflows/test.yml/badge.svg?branch=master)](https://github.com/Kozea/Radicale/actions/workflows/test.yml)\n[![Coverage Status](https://coveralls.io/repos/github/Kozea/Radicale/badge.svg?branch=master)](https://coveralls.io/github/Kozea/Radicale?branch=master)\n\nRadicale is a small but powerful CalDAV (calendars, to-do lists) and CardDAV\n(contacts) server, that:\n\n* Shares calendars and contact lists through CalDAV, CardDAV and HTTP.\n* Supports events, todos, journal entries and business cards.\n* Works out-of-the-box, no complicated setup or configuration required.\n* Can limit access by authentication.\n* Can secure connections with TLS.\n* Works with many CalDAV and CardDAV clients\n* Stores all data on the file system in a simple folder structure.\n* Can be extended with plugins.\n* Is GPLv3-licensed free software.\n\nFor the complete documentation, please visit\n[Radicale master Documentation](https://radicale.org/master.html).\n\nAdditional hints can be found\n* [Radicale Wiki](https://github.com/Kozea/Radicale/wiki)\n* [Radicale Issues](https://github.com/Kozea/Radicale/issues)\n* [Radicale Discussions](https://github.com/Kozea/Radicale/discussions)\n\nBefore reporting an issue, please check\n* [Radicale Wiki / Reporting Issues](https://github.com/Kozea/Radicale/wiki/Reporting-Issues)\n","description_content_type":"text/markdown","docs_url":null,"download_url":null,"downloads":{"last_day":-1,"last_month":-1,"last_week":-1},"dynamic":null,"home_page":null,"keywords":"calendar, addressbook, CalDAV, CardDAV","license":"GNU GPL v3","license_expression":null,"license_files":null,"maintainer":null,"maintainer_email":null,"name":"Radicale","package_url":"https://pypi.org/project/Radicale/","platform":"Any","project_url":"https://pypi.org/project/Radicale/","project_urls":{"Homepage":"https://radicale.org/"},"provides_extra":["test","bcrypt","ldap"],"release_url":"https://pypi.org/project/Radicale/3.5.0/","requires_dist":["defusedxml","passlib","vobject>=0.9.6","pika>=1.1.0","pytest>=7; extra == \"test\"","waitress; extra == \"test\"","bcrypt; extra == \"test\"","bcrypt; extra == \"bcrypt\"","ldap3; extra == \"ldap\""],"requires_python":">=3.9.0","summary":"CalDAV and CardDAV Server","version":"3.5.0","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},"last_serial":42728866,"ownership":{"organization":null,"roles":[{"role":"Owner","user":"gentooboontoo"},{"role":"Owner","user":"liZe"},{"role":"Maintainer","user":"pbiering"},{"role":"Maintainer","user":"unrud"}]},"urls":[{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":{"sha256":"6861bb41ba13f28923deaacebf97b5bfb3f910fcfe81fa34402d92291747a0ed"},"digests":{"blake2b_256":"b6c6c370984088efcfae0d9cc379e11ab8d7472f08aaebf180e6d09ef43cfc8c","md5":"9f020e7e17d3c8b93eb825c42b140a85","sha256":"9e4fd423f238e6ab99fce17861fe035bebbab79b29b006c622f4ca1226e4ed6a"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"radicale-3.5.0-py3-none-any.whl","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"9f020e7e17d3c8b93eb825c42b140a85","packagetype":"bdist_wheel","python_version":"py3","requires_python":">=3.9.0","size":183171,